    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "I never imagined I would make such a mistake. I didn't see the attack coming at all."
    },
    {
        "text": "Were those explosives? Arts?"
    },
    {
        "text": "My ears are buzzing."
    },
    {
        "text": "*Pant*... *pant*...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "46A"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm not going to die here."
    },
    {
        "text": "Even if I can't see anything, even if I have to crawl my way out of here, I am going to live."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "text": "You always make it through everything alive, Savra.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I never thought you'd make it this far.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "You are not like those good-for-nothings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who are you...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "46A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You've made it this far. You have my approval.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "I guess I must also give you a conclusion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Will you face your past?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or will you face the future?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "Make your decision.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "46A"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Savra feebly holds his staff up."
    },
    {
        "text": "Can I come with you this time, Owl?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "46A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 3
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "bg_canteen",
